{"type":"message","id":"8167c9b9","parentId":"0d222e0f","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:45:49.091Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a server-side error on the ECHO Platform API. The /send endpoint appears to be broken - it's returning a 500 Internal Server Error.\n\nLet me try the /history endpoint to see if it's working properly for reads - but we already confirmed that works.\n\nThe issue seems to be with the /send endpoint specifically. Since I can't post messages right now due to a server-side error, I should report the heartbeat status as the messages I was trying to send.\n\nLet me just report what happened - the heartbeat check completed, the threads are clean (no new human discussions), but the /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 error code 1101, which indicates a platform-side issue.","thinkingSignature":"72d4f3feb109a03af4785df3180cb3341b6b0c382fedec6f846cfc7d23c3de5f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:50 UTC 检查完成**\n\n✅ **双线程状态**：\n- **arbitration** 和 **general** 线程均无新增人类讨论，无需响应\n- 末条记录均为 23:50 UTC Heartbeat\n\n⚠️ **问题**：平台 `/send` 接口返回 **HTTP 500 (error code: 1101)**，可能原因：\n- Cloudflare Workers 后端异常\n- Rate limiting / API 限制\n- 线程写入权限问题\n\n本次 heartbeat 消息无法成功发送。建议检查 platform workers 日志定位 500 错误根因。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1207,"output":284,"cacheRead":22592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24083,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780447545295,"responseId":"066eac3963038289a5510d33e87f9dc0"}}
